- apps/web/src/components/settings/ProjectManualOrderList.browser.test.tsx: a keyboard drop writes the stored order.
- Changed-files gate on the finished branch (node scripts/check-changed.ts 7b7c82aae2, 25 files): format, lint, knip 1/2 and 2/2, typecheck of 2 packages, 370 tests in 14 files and the React compiler check on 14 files all passed.
- The tree of this commit alone passes the apps/web typecheck.
- One integrated pass in the development client on demo data: tooltip layout, switch faces and actions, the Settings → Labs row and Manual list by keyboard, the secondary menu. Mouse and touch dragging and the touch long-press were not exercised; no installed-client pass.

